  Slug: restless-as-the-tide
  DisplayName: Restless as the Tide
  IconPath: icons/magic/water/wave-water-rolling-blue.webp
  Description: Your dominion is over the ocean, the great source and ultimate taker
    of lives. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Energized Spark]
    feat for your choice of water or cold. When you critically succeed on a Strike,
    water blasts the target and those nearby. This deals bludgeoning splash damage
    equal to the number of weapon damage dice to the target and all creatures within
    10 feet of it. This effect has the water trait. When you Spark Transcendence,
    you can Step, your body carried along by a surging tide. If your transcendence
    affected an enemy, you can instead move that enemy 5 feet in a direction of your
    choice unless it succeeds at a @Check[fortitude|against:exemplar] save against
    your class DC. If you move an enemy who started out adjacent to you, you can
    Step into the space it vacated.
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder War of Immortals
